            "action_name": {
              "value": "Burrowed Ambush"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The aigamuxa makes a claw Strike against a creature within reach. On a hit, the aigamuxa automatically Grabs the creature. Whether or not they hit, the aigamuxa then Strides. If they have a creature grabbed, the creature moves with the aigamuxa."
